{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Folklore Fishing is a story driven fishing game that is fully playable without visuals. Learn the ropes of fishing and then catch rarer and more difficult fish.  <br><br>Folklore fishing is designed to be completely accessible for the visually impaired. Everything in game is explained using voice acting and all in game queues are clearly distinguishable by sound alone.<br><br>You will have to listen closely to your captain, your rod and the fish you are trying to catch to become a master fisherman.<br><br>Selling your fish will let you upgrade your rod, buy new bait and increase the storage on your boat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you be able to catch any of the Welsh legends?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3702720?t=1748280132","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3702720?t=1748280132","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702720/55e4daab394c9ffb062d9ec2bb85b028993b86ae/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748280132","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702720/55e4daab394c9ffb062d9ec2bb85b028993b86ae/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748280132","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Narrated Game Menus","id":71},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Folklore Fishing is a story driven fishing game that is fully playable without visuals. Learn the ropes of fishing and then catch rarer and more difficult fish.  <br><br>Folklore fishing is designed to be completely accessible for the visually impaired. Everything in game is exp